      "content": "it feels like what you're saying is the only kind thing i've heard in a long time. like im finally seeing a way that they could actually be happy. if i'm just... gone, then all the stress and the money issues and the constant struggle goes with me. they'd finally have space to breathe, wouldnt they?",
